abstract: >-
  Machine-independent terminal configuration: a three-line status line for Claude Code (model,
  path, git state, pull request and toolchain; context, prompt cache, cost and rate-limit gauges;
  system load, host and clock), with Nerd Font, emoji or Unicode icons, a colour-blind-safe palette
  and a layout that follows the width of the terminal, and a two-line blue powerline prompt for
  Starship that stays readable on light and dark terminals. Installers link both into place, so that
  a git pull updates every machine, and never overwrite a per-machine file or edit a shell rc file.
